      "heading": "Follow-up is where systems fail",
      "text": "Paper reports fail at follow-up, not recording. The form goes in a pile, the repair happens, the form is never updated. Months later DVSA asks for the record and sees a defect with no closure attached. Every defect report needs a corresponding closure record. A digital system that auto-flags open defects keeps them red until resolved, so the record is complete by design, not by discipline."
